<title>HUNGARY: Cen. Europe CESI share index drops to 1,522.10 pts.</title>
<headline>Cen. Europe CESI share index drops to 1,522.10 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index eased 0.39 points or 0.03 percent on Tuesday to close at 1,522.10 points, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
